1
00:00:00,589 --> 00:00:03,629
Uh-oh. Turn your pelvis.

2
00:00:06,053 --> 00:00:08,433
[DANCE MUSIC PLAYS
ON TV]

3
00:00:16,897 --> 00:00:20,067
Grab a napkin, homey,
you just got served.

4
00:00:22,236 --> 00:00:23,776
(Leonard:)It's fine. You win.

5
00:00:25,572 --> 00:00:26,742
(Howard:)What's his problem?

6
00:00:27,241 --> 00:00:29,911
(Sheldon:)His imaginary girlfriend
broke up with him.

7
00:00:31,412 --> 00:00:33,412
(Howard:)Been there.

8
00:00:35,249 --> 00:00:36,419
(Penny:)Hello.

9
00:00:36,583 --> 00:00:40,003
(Raj(entering):)Sorry I'm late,
but I was in the hallway, chatting up Penny.

10
00:00:40,504 --> 00:00:41,584
(Howard:)Really? You?

11
00:00:41,755 --> 00:00:43,925
Rajesh Koothrappali spoke to Penny?

12
00:00:44,258 --> 00:00:47,138
(Sheldon:)Actually,
I was less the chatter than the chattee.

13
00:00:47,594 --> 00:00:49,634
(Leonard:)What did she say? Is she still mad at me?

14
00:00:49,805 --> 00:00:51,265
(Raj:)Well, she was upset at first...

15
00:00:51,432 --> 00:00:54,932
(Raj:)...but probably
because her sister shot somebody.

16
00:00:56,311 --> 00:01:00,151
(Raj:)Then there was something about you,
and then she hugged me.

